      "text": "`findTests`, `readPrompt`, `promptRefusal`, `promptSchemaRefusals`, `preflight` and `fillHashes` read Git-visible files through `git.listFiles` and `files`, compute SHA-256 prose hashes through `compute.hash_utf8`, report stale or invalid declarations and unchecked criteria, and update draft `prose_sha256` values through `files.write`."
