      "id": "ac-3",
      "text": "`sourceFilePort` (`portStat`, `portRead`), `captureSource`, and `createStrictSourceAccess` (`strictSourceFilePort`, `strictFindTests`, `strictCaptureSource`) read bounded repository source, compute `raw_file_hashes` and `source_sha256`, and enforce the strict no-symlink rule on symlinked paths."
    },
    {
      "id": "ac-4",
      "text": "Invalid inputs, nonzero `git.listFiles` replies, secret paths, and strict symlink accesses raise the declared entry error (`invalid-story-source`, `invalid-story-path`, `invalid-match-input`, `invalid-test-descriptor`, `invalid-scenario-path`, `invalid-check-input`, `invalid-interface-input`, `invalid-prompt-descriptor`, or `PreflightError`)."
